- Links to iteration tasks (I2.T8, etc.) are present and correctly anchored
- Existing content (Maven profiles, tooling) is preserved

**Script Validation:**
- All environment variables documented
- Header includes complete usage examples
- TODO sections reference specific iteration tasks
- No breaking changes to existing functionality

